 phh-on-boot.sh      |  76 ++++++++++++++++++
 phh-prop-handler.sh |  28 +++++++
 rw-system.sh        | 189 +++++++++++++++++++++++---------------------
 vndk.rc             |  46 +++++++++--
 5 files changed, 255 insertions(+), 98 deletions(-)

